OL,11,CSaturday:FClear skies at first
OL,12,Fbecoming cloudy during the afternoon,
OL,13,Fthough sunny spells are likely. Winds
OL,14,Flight and variable. Feeling hot.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudy
OL,17,Fwith coastal showers during Sunday,
OL,18,Fclearing to sunny spells Monday and
OL,19,Fthrough Tuesday. Turning hotter
OL,20,Fthrough next week.
